abstract: >-
  Application-level distributed retrieval with independent Qdrant databases,
  HTTP routing and aggregation, per-query evaluation and captured-network
  measurements, plus an empirical Monte Carlo simulator and a local web interface.
keywords:
  - distributed retrieval
  - retrieval augmented generation
  - network measurement
  - Monte Carlo simulation
  - reproducibility
